    <string name="vpn_servers_title">VPN Servers</string>
    <string name="vpn_servers_disclaimer_title">Import &amp; manage only, for now</string>
    <string name="vpn_servers_disclaimer_body">This screen imports and stores your OpenVPN (.ovpn) and WireGuard (.conf) config files and lets you pick one as active. It does not yet establish a tunnel through them - that needs the official OpenVPN/WireGuard client engines integrated, which is a separate, larger piece of work. No server list is bundled: only servers you provide, from a source you trust, ever get added here.</string>
